	(text "SHIELD -> GND: C101 1 nF 2 kV || R101-R105 (10 Mohm).\nR-32 hipot: <= 1.2 kVpk on J101's internal 1 nF,\n<= 1.23 kVpk on C101. AC hipot only.\nESD +-8 kV: 1.33 kV peak, 267 V per resistor.\nA-shield-network.md"
